      "instance_name": "three_women",
      "label": "central subjects",
      "description": "Three women are seated closely together in the foreground, smiling at the camera. They are dressed in formal or semi-formal attire — one in a black top with a quilted skirt, one in a light-colored strapless dress, and one in a teal dress. Their appearance is polished, and they are the focal point of the image, with overlaid text making them the subject of the meme's hateful message.",
