      "instance_name": "meme_scene",
      "label": "Three women posing together with hateful overlaid text",
      "description": "The scene centers on three women seated closely together in the foreground, smiling at the camera. They are the focal point of the image, with overlaid text that reads 'the only kkk to ever let black men in.' The text is positioned above and below the women, framing them as the subject of the meme's hateful message. The background contains other people seated at tables, but they are out of focus and do not interact with the main subjects. The spatial arrangement places the three women centrally, with the text overlaying the image to create a confrontational and offensive composition.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
