      "instance_name": "ku_klux_klan",
      "label": "Ku Klux Klan",
      "description": "A historically white supremacist organization in the United States that used violence and intimidation to enforce racial segregation and suppress Black civil rights, particularly in the post-Civil War South. The meme falsely implies that the KKK ever allowed Black men into its ranks, which is factually incorrect and deeply offensive, using the KKK as a tool for racial insult.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
