      "description": "A meme designed to spread hate, provoke, or demean a specific group based on race, ethnicity, or other identity markers. This meme uses false historical claims and offensive imagery to insult Black people by falsely associating them with the Ku Klux Klan, which is a form of racial hate speech.",
