      "instance_name": "white_supremacist_ideology",
      "label": "White Supremacist Ideology",
      "description": "A belief system that promotes the superiority of the white race and the inferiority or subjugation of other races. The meme leverages this ideology by falsely implying that the KKK — a white supremacist group — ever allowed Black men in, thereby mocking and distorting its own racist principles to insult Black people.",
