      "instance_name": "historical_fact_distortion",
      "label": "Historical Fact Distortion",
      "description": "The intentional misrepresentation or falsification of historical events or facts to serve a hateful or misleading purpose. The meme falsely claims that the KKK ever allowed Black men into its ranks, which is a distortion of the KKK's actual history of racial exclusion and violence.",
